Package: ragnar-taskmanager
Version: 0.1.0-5
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: LieraOS Project <projekt@lieraos.local>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.10), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.7), procps, systemd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: 3948
Description: Ragnar Task Manager — processes, performance and services
 Native GTK4/libadwaita task manager for the Ragnar desktop:
 live process list with search, terminate/kill and priority
 control; CPU/RAM/disk/network/GPU performance graphs; systemd
 service management over D-Bus; XDG autostart editor and system
 information — all data from procfs/sysfs, Wayland-native.
 Launched via the compositor keybind Ctrl+Shift+Esc.
Homepage: https://github.com/LieraOS/Ragnar
